/// IT'S ABOUT A STEEL ART OBJECT THAT WAS BRIEFLY FASCINATED WITH ITS OWN SELF ///

/// HAMMERED THEN BRIEFLY ENAMORED ///

A band member dropped something while Sona Jobarteh was in a train of thought and saying something. SJ said, "I'm smiling but I'm actually not smiling. Where did I leave off. What was I saying."  She has her own kind of sense of humor.
